e' (2025-12), state regulators intervened where voluntary corporate guardrails failed. Technical verification protocols create regulatory moats for incumbents while leaving affected populations with zero legal recourse when algorithms cause real-world injury.\n\nWho pays the water and carbon bill for the $244 billion artificial intelligence industry when the tokens clear and the taps run dry?",
